        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek S901HN, Keyed Hanover Stainless Steel Lever with Disk Rosette</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Keyed Hanover Stainless Lever with Disk Rose has a brushed stainless steel finish that really brings out the modern shape of this keyed entry door lever. Together with the modern Disk Rose, the Hanover Leverset is perfect for any contemporary home. The Keyed Hanover Stainless Steel Lever with Disk Rosette is available in two functions: a keyed entry--where a key operates the latch from the exterior--and a dummy key in lever--which does not latch nor lock. The Hanover Keyed Entryset will fit doors with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets that are 1-1/4 inches to 2-3/4 inches thick.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available <a href=\"/products/hanover-key-in-lever-with-disk-rose-emtek-5115hn\"><b>Brass Hanover Key in Lever with Disk Rose</b></a> in 6 different finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> for the Emtek Stainless Steel Hanover Keyed Entry Lever with Round Disk Rosette:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Brushed Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 5-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Clearance: 2-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Thickness: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Doors Thickness: 1-1/4\" - 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-S901HN-specifications.pdf?v=1704262351\" target=\"new\"><b>Emtek S901HN Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Keyed Entry (Keyed Lock):</b> Use when a keyed lock is needed. The lock is operated by a key from the exterior and a thumbturn on the lever from the interior. Complete set - 2 levers, 2 roses, keys, door latch, and strike plate.\r\n<li><b>Dummy:</b> Trim for non-working doors. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nLevers are Handed. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Handing Guide</b></a>\r\n</p>",
